api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":107613988,"digest":"sha256:738d3bf868d8af5b85b3e81360d9e16a165af1b3a9ba3f993852e7828133f532","download_count":51,"created_at":"2026-03-04T13:48:05Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T13:49:25Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.2.0/Advancely-v1.2.0-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.2.0","body":"Don't worry! Bigger features will be on the horizon, but I wanted to get this release out to have the Hermes Live Tracking Functionality back in place as it is now legalized for Advancely to use.\r\n\r\n# The most notable changes of this release include:\r\n- The re-implementation of the Support for the Hermes Live Tracking mod.\r\n<img width=\"799\" height=\"363\" alt=\"Hermes is back\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8a819cb-8d1f-443a-af1d-c1b4678aecda\" />\r\n\r\n- Settings are now organized into tabs for more clarity and to provide space for Coop settings (coming soon...).\r\n<img width=\"605\" height=\"480\" alt=\"Setting tabs\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71c8fccf-4aa4-4536-880d-d4b3c8fa494b\" />\r\n\r\n- Exporting and importing templates now allows icon files to go with it. Good for modded temples custom icon textures that Advancely doesn't have by default.\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"267\" alt=\"Export with icons\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1139106e-5261-4f03-a381-9012e8bdb777\" />\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"331\" alt=\"Import with icons\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e278b37-73c4-4981-bd8c-fc64faadb4f1\" />\r\n\r\n- Within the template editor goals can now be sorted based on badge-numbers. Clicking `Sort` then rearranges the goals within their spots and `Reset Order` resets their badges. More detailed explanation [here](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely?tab=readme-ov-file#the-template-editor-esc--edit-templates).\r\n<img width=\"1369\" height=\"739\" alt=\"Sorting Badges\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85d17df9-8942-4029-9301-22ef457d6656\" />\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [main tracker page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update!"}